 to these episode notes once the campaign is live. You can find Matthew on his website:&amp;nbsp; To help support the show, share it, or rate and review on your podcast service of choice. To support us financially, please donate on Patreon: &amp;nbsp; Want to join the conversation? Come to the Story Told Discord server:&amp;nbsp; Our music is composed by James Horan. To contact him regarding composition, send him an email:&amp;nbsp;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"117b797e63707f2828517e61657e7f7d787f743f7f7465\">[email&#160;protected]</a> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T01:00:20-07:00","id":1344856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1342349-what-we-know-so-far-mummy-the-curse-2nd-edition?p=1344757#post1344757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't know what Discord found out, but my googlefu says Nesrem means a &quot;Divine Bull&quot;. An Arabic definition seems to point to some oracle statues at Cabul, which I don't know if that was the intention.<br /> <br /> Anyway- yay, Immortals! My favorite Blue Book splat (tied with Inferno)!. The fact that the Eternals show up in it makes no surprises, considering their connection to relics. I also expect to see the Visitors (hope for some &quot;alien-from-beyond-the-stars&quot;) take on them, and the Reborn (which were referenced in Dark Era and make sense due to their reincarnation cycle- kinda the opposite of the Arisen). I hope to see updated Purified, but as I am also afraid of it, due to me really loving those guys. Harvesters also make way too much sense as part of Mummy, IMO (I think the book did mentioned an egyptian origin for them). Other than Immortals, Sekhem Sorcerers also excite me, and I am still waiting to see more of those &quot;minor Guilds&quot; which were mentioned before.<br /> <br /> Exciting times indeed.</div> </div> </div> </div>The four Immortals we're getting in the core are the Blood Bathers, the Body Thieves, the Eternals and the Reborn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T02:09:22-07:00","id":1344861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1342349-what-we-know-so-far-mummy-the-curse-2nd-edition?p=1344856#post1344856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The four Immortals we're getting in the core are the Blood Bathers, the Body Thieves, the Eternals and the Reborn.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed. There will be minor sections on the rest, which I'd hope to see expanded in future books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T04:42:07-07:00","id":1344893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</