com/member/281-atamajakki\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar281_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"281\" data-vbnamecard=\"281\">atamajakki</a>. I know that quite a few people who run games in my area (myself included) don't bother with mechanics or dice rolls for preludes because nothing of significance will occur that we haven't already talked about in advance; such as meeting an Ally or Mentor for the first time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T18:46:33-08:00","id":1345686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1342349-what-we-know-so-far-mummy-the-curse-2nd-edition?p=1345685#post1345685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is a Prelude <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>. I know that quite a few people who run games in my area (myself included) don't bother with mechanics or dice rolls for preludes because nothing of significance will occur that we haven't already talked about in advance; such as meeting an Ally or Mentor for the first time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. Been into these games since... 2009 and have never once seen that. Weird!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T19:22:52-08:00","id":1345687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1342349-what-we-know-so-far-mummy-the-curse-2nd-edition?p=1345686#post1345686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Huh. Been into these games since... 2009 and have never once seen that. Weird!</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, Red Moon Roleplaying edit their shows to be more like audio dramas than games with dice rolling and HP breakdown, etc. While there may be mechanics narrated in future episodes, don't expect a big crunchy breakdown. It's a story that'll largely be told through character dialogue and action, and Storyteller narration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color: